   [#D7D7AF][/dim]with the copy configurable per pane from a sidecar's ref spec or [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the user's sase.yml.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifacts_subtab_descriptions.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/artifacts_subtab_descriptions.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-u6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-u6/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pane description resolution layer[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]resolve[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve: add a total, auditable description resolution ladder (user [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config → provider ref.pane → built-in copy → generated fallback), author[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the built-in copy, carry summary/body/source on the compiled pane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract, fix the descriptor cache token, and expose it all through sase[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]artifact pane show and the config schema.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The pane brief[/bold #D7AFFF]                                                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]brief[dim] · [dim][/dim]after resolve[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]brief: render the resolved description as a host-owned accent-gutter [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]brief under the Artifacts sub-tab strip, with an off/summary/full mode [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycled by a new key, a click, or the command palette and seeded from [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]config.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Sub-tab hover tooltips[/bold #D7AFFF]                                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]hover[dim] · [dim][/dim]after brief[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]hover: teach the shared PanelTabStrip to carry a per-tab description and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]show it as a hover tooltip using the same cell-accurate hit test its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]click handler uses, then feed it the Artifacts descriptors.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual goldens and end-to-end verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]goldens[dim] · [dim][/dim]after hover[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]goldens: add new PNG goldens for the brief's three modes and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unconfigured provider hint, rebaseline every Artifacts golden the new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row shifts, and run the full verification lane.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-u6","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-u6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-29d1913c65ae9c47a577cf7de6134af8","started_at":"2026-08-26T11:56:52.802366+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[{"committed_at":1787757835,"sha":"ceaa377fe3d539948edaac34bcb401fe630d658b","subject":"feat(artifacts): add the pane description brief"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"7b2d3aeaa4c5f9b5ec9cc60c89c80ad8b85e1bcbf7d3a53abaa1c74c34e0d23e","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-u6.2/chat.md","size_bytes":7563},"commits":{"digest":"aca66cc8617c0331b987647339c4d693f5f2c57c795c72cd51c1a22899adf65c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-u6.2/commits.json","size_bytes":225},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387